Users can set a spending limit for different categories.

Example:

Category	Monthly Budget

Food	₹4,000
Travel	₹3,000
Shopping	₹2,000
Entertainment	₹1,000


6.5 Expense Analysis

The application analyzes spending and displays:

Total income

Total expenses

Remaining money

Highest spending category

Savings amount

Budget usage


6.6 AI Recommendation System

This is the main intelligent feature.

The AI can analyze spending information and generate personalized recommendations.

Examples:

"You are close to reaching your shopping budget."

"Your travel expenses increased compared with your previous period."

"You can consider reducing non-essential expenses to reach your savings goal."


