Laptop

Phone

Education

Trip

Emergency savings


The application tracks progress toward the selected goal.

6.8 Budget Alerts

The system can provide alerts when spending approaches or exceeds a budget limit.

6.9 Dashboard

A simple dashboard can display financial information using:

Pie charts

Bar charts

Progress bars

Expense summaries

Budget indicators



