7. AI Component

The AI component makes PocketSmart different from a basic expense tracker.

AI inputs

The system can consider:

Income

Expense categories

Spending amounts

Budget limits

Savings target

Previous spending patterns


AI processing

The system identifies patterns and generates understandable recommendations.

AI output

The user receives suggestions such as:

"You have spent ₹3,800 of your ₹4,000 food budget. You have ₹200 remaining for this category."

or

"You are spending more on shopping than your planned budget. Consider reviewing non-essential purchases."

The application should present these as informational recommendations, not guaranteed financial advice.


---

8. Target Users

PocketSmart AI can be designed for:

