14. Final Brainstorming Outcome

The brainstorming and ideation phase resulted in the following project concept:

> PocketSmart AI is an intelligent budgeting assistant that helps users record income and expenses, set budgets and savings goals, analyze spending patterns, and receive personalized AI-generated recommendations through a simple dashboard.



Project Flow

Identify Problem → Brainstorm Ideas → Compare Solutions → Select PocketSmart AI → Define Features → Select Technologies → Design AI Recommendation Concept → Move to Planning & Design Phase

Conclusion

The Brainstorming & Ideation Phase established the basic vision, objectives, target users, features, AI functionality, and technology direction for PocketSmart AI. The selected concept focuses on making personal budgeting simple, understandable, and personalized, providing the foundation for the next phases of development.
